	(text "Signal flows left to right: emitter, detector, gain, comparator, cable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 52.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1503d65a-01cb-460e-ae46-8b94d31e8077")
	)
	(text "PULSED EMITTER - 20 kHz / 5 us / ~500 mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1a87e4fb-375c-426a-8eb5-386b69f2873d")
	)
	(text "Ground sits between OPT_LED_EN and OPT_COMP. Emitter-pulse crosstalk onto\nOPT_COMP lands inside the synchronous gating window and would be accepted as a\ngenuine hit, so it must be stopped here, not filtered downstream. Use a latching,\ngold-plated JST series with secondary retention: tin friction contacts fret under\nsustained vibration and fail intermittently rather than cleanly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2235d0fd-70cc-47d0-ba11-27ccc55f180d")
	)
	(text "PD1 cathode on the summing node, anode to GND (Rev B): photocurrent is pulled OUT\nof the node, so TIA_OUT rises, OPT_AMP falls and the comparator can cross 1.016 V.\nReversed, U4 never trips."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "270adb21-3afd-42a0-b6aa-5ea5354f04d2")
	)
	(text "1.65 V REFERENCE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5ba54c47-288b-4aa2-a877-97b9e2f03a8d")
	)
	(text "SUPPLY + ERC FLAGS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d84fea3-715b-47ae-8b37-941cb5a8e37d")
	)
	(text "CABLE TO MAIN BOARD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 340.36 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e8bac03-d166-4fd6-9d1a-5d88c83e1aac")
	)
	(text "R28 senses U4's own output, upstream of the R32 series damping."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2e6626f-228a-440d-aff1-45a8622a0a26")
	)
	(text "BalancerREF_OptHead - optical tach head, at 90 degrees to the main PCB on the\naluminium L-bracket. One pivot bolt aims the emitter; add a second fastener (arc\nslot or serrated lock nut) or it drifts under vibration and loses RPM lock. The\nbaffle between D1 and PD1 and the red acrylic window belong to this board.\nDesignators match BalancerREF Rev C so the existing pin audits stay valid."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aedbe031-eea9-4565-8f06-7a030c4b140d")
	)
	(text "Emitter loop is local: C20 supplies the 5 us / 500 mA pulse so the cable carries\nonly the ~50 mA average. R19 damps the gate edge; R20 holds Q1 off while the main\nboard is unpowered or the cable is unplugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b746c11d-b92e-4f1b-954a-777bee0d2a4a")
	)
	(text "DETECTOR > TRANSIMPEDANCE > x12 AC GAIN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d64acbea-f753-4ec8-9cc2-5d7758eba5b1")
	)
	(text "THRESHOLD COMPARATOR + HYSTERESIS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e5fd3b67-c784-4752-9027-313a10d3f540")
	)
